Panduan Instalasi/ Aktivasi API

Macbook:
1. Buat Environment: 
    Perintah bash: "python3 -m venv env"
2. Aktifkan Environment
    Perintah bash: "source env/bin/activate"
3. Instalasi Library di requirements.txt
    Perintah bash: "pip install -r requirements.txt"
4. Jalankan Program
    Perintah bash: "python3 app.py"

Windows:
1. Buat Environment: 
    Perintah bash: "python -m venv env"
2. Aktifkan Environment
    Perintah bash: "env\Scripts\activate"
3. Instalasi Library di requirements.txt
    Perintah bash: "pip install -r requirements.txt"
4. Jalankan Program
    Perintah bash: "python app.py"
